WEBVTT

00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:13.700
At last, we faced off with Gil.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:15.870
What? You're not Gil?!

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:20.040
Behind the metal mask was
Chase's brother, Tristan.

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:23.950
My journey won't end till I avenge my father!

00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:47.910
"Eli, Nevada"

00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:53.830
"Episode 8: HEAVY RAIN"

00:01:56.660 --> 00:01:58.160
You fix it?

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:04.660
Yeah, but it'll take a little longer
to finish the hybrid engine.

00:02:04.660 --> 00:02:10.830
I see. It's almost time to leave, so it'll
have to wait till the next supply point.

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:13.540
We're way behind the leader pack,

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:17.000
but once you finish it, we'll catch right up.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:19.620
Right, Appare? Hmm?

00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:23.250
He's out like a light. Huh?

00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:25.450
It's time! Get a move on!

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:29.330
Whoa, I overslept! Be right there!

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:31.330
Argh, shoot!

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:34.500
--Hey, Hototo!
--Squeak?

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:36.950
Not you! The old one!

00:02:36.950 --> 00:02:38.450
Change its name.

00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:41.200
We're leaving! Get the luggage!

00:02:53.790 --> 00:02:55.750
Is this a good idea?

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:59.540
We can't just sit here and
wait for Appare to wake up.

00:02:59.540 --> 00:03:01.540
I can handle it!

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:03.750
Whoa! Hey! Careful!

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:05.540
Don't talk! You'll bite your tongue!

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:06.950
Just drive it normal!

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:09.370
--That's the hardest part!
--What?!

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:10.830
--Don't 'what' me! I've got this!
--Appare?

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:11.540
--Don't 'what' me! I've got this!
--No, it's Kosame!

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:13.200
--You suck at driving!
--No, it's Kosame!

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:19.330
Shove it! As Kosame Isshiki,
Hangetsu Ittoryu master, I will succeed!

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:21.540
It's time for the racers to start!

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:23.330
Good! Let's go!

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:26.870
Let's close the gap!

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:30.000
Here we go!

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:33.580
Clutch! Shift up!

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:35.500
Speed it up a bit!

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:38.750
Just shut up and stay in your seat, kid!

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:42.200
What are they doing?

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:43.410
Step on it!

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:44.370
I am!

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:47.950
I bet I could do better, you coward!

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:49.660
Move over, Kosame.

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:51.410
Appare!

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:53.160
Should've woken me up.

00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:55.000
Has that ever worked?

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.250
--Yes.
--No.

00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:59.790
Hold on to your butts.

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:02.160
The race must go on!

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:09.700
There he is!

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:14.450
Let's do this! Here we go!

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:26.870
Is that... the leader pack?

00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:30.450
What happened?

00:04:43.870 --> 00:04:45.540
You're kidding!

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:49.450
This is... awful.

00:04:49.450 --> 00:04:52.040
He's still breathing!

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:53.620
You okay?

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:56.660
Yeah. They hit my head.

00:04:56.660 --> 00:04:58.540
What happened?

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:03.700
We were driving, but then men on horses
appeared out of nowhere.

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:04.910
Bandits, huh?

00:05:04.910 --> 00:05:08.160
No. Bandits would've killed me, too.

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:09.950
What then?

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:15.580
"Everyone in this race will die."

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:19.000
They told me to pass the message on.

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:21.120
Just who are they?

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:26.620
I don't know... But their leader
had something on his neck--

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:28.330
Gil the Snake.

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:34.080
Could he be the real Gil?

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:36.160
Where are you going, Hototo?

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:37.500
After them.

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:40.000
After them? How?

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:47.700
Five horses walked slowly north from here.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:49.750
You can tell that much?

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:53.750
I believe there's a small
post town to the north.

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:56.040
Let's return to the city and get help--

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:57.580
They'll get away!

00:05:57.580 --> 00:06:01.370
And you'll stop them?
Calm down. The race is still--

00:06:01.370 --> 00:06:06.410
You don't know what it's like
to watch your family get killed!

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:15.120
Tell him, Appare. Let's just continue the race.

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:17.370
Hototo, get in.

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:19.830
Appare, I...!

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:21.580
--We'll find 'em.
--Huh?

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:22.660
Huh?

00:06:22.660 --> 00:06:28.330
I dunno who they are, but they did this
to cars I was gonna pass.

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:33.500
This is a statement to everyone
taking part in the race.

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:36.370
Appare! Not you, too!

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:39.080
I imagine the post town has a sheriff.

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:44.750
True... And it's safer for the race
if they're captured as soon as possible.

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:46.290
--But...!
--I'll go back to the city for help.

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:48.330
--I'll go back to the city for help.

00:06:48.330 --> 00:06:49.700
Good idea.

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:01.080
Stop!

00:07:03.870 --> 00:07:07.000
The footprints go towards that town.

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:09.580
So that's where they went?

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:28.450
Excuse me. Did five men on horses
come through here?

00:07:28.450 --> 00:07:29.950
Beats me.

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:36.410
Have you seen any suspicious men with guns?

00:07:36.410 --> 00:07:37.910
Bugger off.

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:41.410
It seems we're not welcome here.

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:45.830
I'll go ask the sheriff if they'll lend a hand.

00:07:45.830 --> 00:07:47.500
Appare, come along.

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:48.330
Okay.

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:50.370
Let's go ask around.

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:51.500
All right.

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:56.750
Excuse me!

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:59.660
What do you want?

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:02.450
A saloon is no place for a kid.

00:08:02.450 --> 00:08:05.200
Have you seen any suspicious men?

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:07.750
There's one right beside you.

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:10.200
No, five men on horses.

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:13.660
One with a snake tattoo on his neck.

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:17.870
If you're not drinking, get lost! I'm busy here.

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:21.750
Please tell us if you've seen them.
They're dangerous.

00:08:22.790 --> 00:08:26.290
If I were you, I'd skip town in a hurry.

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:27.450
Huh?

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:34.000
I see. You can't really blame 'em.

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:38.750
It's a small town here.
Most don't take kindly to outsiders.

00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:42.200
Are there any deputies who could help out, too?

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:45.830
Out here in the boonies? Got a gun?

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:46.870
Yeah.

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:48.700
My weapon's up here.

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:51.830
Okay. Let's get lookin'.

00:08:54.620 --> 00:08:58.410
Maybe it's best if we just leave town.

00:08:58.410 --> 00:09:00.660
We don't even know if they're here.

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:02.580
Wait in the car if you're scared.

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:04.700
I'm not, but...

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:07.000
You looking for someone?

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:07.750
Uh...

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:13.290
A group of five men with snake tattoos, was it?

00:09:13.290 --> 00:09:17.290
You mean, like this one right here?

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:23.160
Gil the Snake... You killed those racers...

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:25.410
And what if we did?

00:09:30.450 --> 00:09:31.660
Appare!

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:33.790
Don't move!

00:09:34.660 --> 00:09:36.080
Put down your guns!

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:39.540
It's you who's gonna put down the gun.

00:09:39.540 --> 00:09:42.450
Sorry, pal.

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:56.830
You coward! Are you Gil?

00:09:56.830 --> 00:10:01.370
If I am Gil, you're all as good as dead.

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:04.660
You, too. Hands in the air.

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:08.580
Both of 'em, idiot!
Face that way or you're dead!

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:10.790
My father...!

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:12.370
Your father?

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:15.620
You killed my father and stole our land!

00:10:15.620 --> 00:10:20.330
As if I could remember everyone I've killed.

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:22.160
Calm down, Hototo.

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:25.540
We'll leave town, all right? Just let us go.

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:28.870
There's no land in this country for your kind.

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:32.120
It's a shame you're not dead.

00:10:32.120 --> 00:10:34.580
Your land's on the other side.

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:45.040
You'll pay!

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:46.750
Don't!

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:48.330
You little...!

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:49.620
Xialian!

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:02.790
Appare!

00:11:02.790 --> 00:11:04.580
Stay put!

00:11:06.450 --> 00:11:11.950
Toss 'em in jail. We'll hang 'em at sundown
to serve as an example.

00:11:11.950 --> 00:11:14.120
What about that one?

00:11:14.120 --> 00:11:18.410
Leave 'em. It's the cowards that live longest.

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:22.660
Got that right!

00:11:44.750 --> 00:11:48.620
You're bad for business sittin' there like that.

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:50.910
Here.

00:11:50.910 --> 00:11:55.040
I don't know what happened,
but at least you're alive.

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:58.660
Forget everything that happened and go home.

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:02.410
I can't forget something like that.

00:12:02.410 --> 00:12:03.620
Hmm?

00:12:04.830 --> 00:12:07.290
I couldn't protect anyone.

00:12:07.290 --> 00:12:10.200
Not then, and not now.

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:11.870
Not then?

00:12:22.620 --> 00:12:26.620
It happened when I was nine...

00:12:27.660 --> 00:12:29.950
On a cold, winter day...

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:34.830
Learn anything today, Kosame?

00:12:34.830 --> 00:12:38.870
Yes, Mother! I passed the abacus test today!

00:12:38.870 --> 00:12:42.620
Really? You can teach Fumi when we get home.

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:43.910
Okay!

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:50.910
--Huh?
--Kosame!

00:12:58.160 --> 00:12:59.870
Mother?

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:08.370
I couldn't do anything.

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:11.620
I just... stood there.

00:13:11.620 --> 00:13:15.040
Not much you could do. You were a kid, right?

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:18.160
But I'm not anymore.

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:22.160
And here I trained with all my heart...

00:13:23.870 --> 00:13:27.000
For what reason did you become strong?

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:28.410
Huh?

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:31.250
Running a saloon in a place like this,

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:37.620
you learn to tell the difference between
the strong ones and the ones faking it.

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:41.080
For what reason...?

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:47.620
No matter how strong you are,
you can't change the past.

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:50.790
Your dead mother isn't coming back.

00:13:51.790 --> 00:13:55.250
So, don't go throwing your life away.

00:13:55.250 --> 00:13:57.620
Once you're done, head home.

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:20.830
I'm such... a tremendous fool.

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:22.790
This revenge...

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:25.330
It won't bring anyone back.

00:14:26.410 --> 00:14:32.540
Talking all haughty like that...
Yet I'm the one enslaved by the past.

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:36.620
Swinging my sword to fight a nightmare...

00:14:36.620 --> 00:14:39.660
A nightmare that can't be beaten...

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:57.120
Ma'am, may I have a glass of water?

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:59.120
You going?

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:01.450
The past won't change.

00:15:01.450 --> 00:15:05.540
But I do have comrades I can still protect.

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:12.290
Thank you.

00:15:12.290 --> 00:15:13.790
Wait up.

00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:16.500
Want this?

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:20.370
No. This should be more than enough for me.

00:15:21.660 --> 00:15:24.120
Enough! Untie them!

00:15:24.120 --> 00:15:28.120
Let 'em down! They've got
nothing to do with this!

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:31.750
I... Because of me...

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:34.950
What a waste!

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:36.870
--Don't touch me!
--Whoops!

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:40.330
Shit! Is there anything we can do, Appare?

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:43.330
There is. Just one.

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:44.450
We wait.

00:15:44.450 --> 00:15:45.620
Wait?

00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:48.450
There's no way he'd leave us behind.

00:15:49.870 --> 00:15:55.160
That coward is probably
drowning his sorrows somewhere.

00:15:55.160 --> 00:15:56.120
Got that right!

00:15:56.120 --> 00:15:59.410
Let's get this over with and go home.

00:16:03.450 --> 00:16:04.580
Huh?

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:19.160
Kosame?

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:30.080
What'd you come back for?

00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:38.450
He's shakin' in his boots!

00:16:38.450 --> 00:16:41.000
Run away, Kosame!

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:44.290
What are you doing? You're weak!

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:47.790
Because of me, everyone will...!

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:51.410
You don't need to be tough, Hototo.

00:16:51.410 --> 00:16:55.580
Kids should just be kids
and ask others for help.

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:58.080
Kosame...

00:16:58.080 --> 00:17:02.580
If you wanna die that badly,
we can hang you, too.

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:07.160
--Huh?
--Kosame!

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:10.330
Mother!

00:17:22.200 --> 00:17:24.000
M-My gun!

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:28.370
Kosame?

00:17:31.080 --> 00:17:33.700
Master of Hangetsu Ittoryu,

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:36.660
Kosame Isshiki has come!

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:38.410
Catch!

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:40.120
Dammit!

00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:41.700
He dodged it!

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:47.450
Kill 'em! Kill 'em!

00:17:50.830 --> 00:17:51.830
Tsk!

00:17:54.700 --> 00:17:58.540
He's reading their movements
to predict where they'll shoot.

00:17:58.540 --> 00:18:02.750
Incredible... So this is the real Kosame?

00:18:02.750 --> 00:18:04.040
Don't move!

00:18:12.290 --> 00:18:13.450
You okay?

00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:15.040
Y-Yeah.

00:18:15.040 --> 00:18:18.700
You shits! Die, die, die!

00:18:28.160 --> 00:18:30.370
Damn you! Damn you! Damn you!

00:18:30.370 --> 00:18:32.330
You damn brat!

00:18:32.330 --> 00:18:35.450
It's time to pay your father a visit!

00:18:42.120 --> 00:18:44.500
Hey! Quit it, Hototo!

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:47.620
Let go, Kosame! My father! He killed my--

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:50.040
My mother was killed, too!

00:18:50.950 --> 00:18:53.910
As a child, I couldn't do anything.

00:18:53.910 --> 00:18:58.660
The horror and regret still haunt me, even now.

00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:01.120
--Then you know--
--Even so!

00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:02.750
Even so...

00:19:02.750 --> 00:19:06.330
I won't let you stain your hands with his blood.

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:10.290
That's an adult's job.

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:17.830
Put down your gun and surrender.
I want to avoid needless death.

00:19:17.830 --> 00:19:21.660
Rest assured. It's you that's gonna die!

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:27.040
Not good. When he sways his gun,
it's hard to predict where he'll shoot.

00:19:27.040 --> 00:19:29.950
What's more, he's got two of 'em.

00:19:31.410 --> 00:19:35.330
What's wrong? Not gonna draw your sword?

00:19:35.330 --> 00:19:37.120
You needn't worry.

00:19:38.250 --> 00:19:39.870
Is that right?

00:19:45.620 --> 00:19:46.830
Gotcha!

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:56.120
Hangetsu Ittoryu secret move!

00:19:57.910 --> 00:20:01.330
Fury Eternal Wary Moon!

00:20:10.700 --> 00:20:16.200
There's no right or wrong.
There's that which happens as one carries on.

00:20:18.200 --> 00:20:19.620
Took long enough.

00:20:19.620 --> 00:20:20.660
Sorry.

00:20:20.660 --> 00:20:22.910
Thanks, Kosame. You saved us.

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:24.910
I knew you were strong!

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:29.160
No... The path to true strength is a long one.

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:30.870
Back to the race.

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:35.870
That's right. Dylan and TJ
may have passed us up by now.

00:20:35.870 --> 00:20:37.700
Kosame.

00:20:37.700 --> 00:20:39.040
Hmm?

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:41.700
Um...

00:20:46.250 --> 00:20:49.450
You don't have to say anything for now.

00:20:50.830 --> 00:20:55.620
If you wanna run back to your mommy,
you can leave whenever you want.

00:20:59.120 --> 00:21:01.450
Don't treat me like a child!

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:07.040
And here I figured you'd get yourself killed.

00:21:07.040 --> 00:21:08.660
Thanks for everything.

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:14.000
Be careful. People say their boss
is even worse than them.

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:15.750
Gil, huh?

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:21.500
It doesn't matter who it is.
I... We've gotta keep moving forward.

00:21:22.910 --> 00:21:24.500
Take care.

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:33.910
Jing Xialian, Al Lyon,
and Team Appare have arrived!

00:21:33.910 --> 00:21:36.450
"Denver, Colorado"
Jing Xialian, Al Lyon,
and Team Appare have arrived!

00:21:36.450 --> 00:21:36.870
"Denver, Colorado"
With Dylan, TJ, and Richard in the lead
and the Bad Brothers at the tail,

00:21:36.870 --> 00:21:41.250
With Dylan, TJ, and Richard in the lead
and the Bad Brothers at the tail,

00:21:41.250 --> 00:21:44.450
there's currently only seven cars able to race!

00:21:44.450 --> 00:21:48.200
As expected, it's quite the chaotic race!

00:21:49.500 --> 00:21:54.250
Was it wise to go and pull a stunt like that?

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:59.450
I think you know, but it's a problem
if the public finds out about us.

00:21:59.450 --> 00:22:03.370
All you need to do is focus on
the race. Don't get fancy and--

00:22:03.370 --> 00:22:05.580
Don't you worry.

00:22:05.580 --> 00:22:09.410
This "new era" they speak of won't come.

00:22:09.410 --> 00:22:12.580
I just wanted to let them know that.

00:22:13.870 --> 00:22:18.370
In any case, I'm counting on you, Gil T. Cigar.

00:23:46.700 --> 00:23:47.450
"Next time"

00:23:47.450 --> 00:23:49.910
"Episode 9: short break"
